### GET request to example server
GET https://examples.http-client.intellij.net/get
    ?generated-in=GoLand


### 1. 健康检查
GET http://localhost:8080/health


### 2. 注册用户
POST http://localhost:8085/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "wangwu",
  "password": "12345678",
  "nickname": "爱吃火锅的小五"
}


### 3. 用户登录
POST http://localhost:8085/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "wangwu",
  "password": "12345678"
}


### 4. 使用JWT查询当前用户
GET http://localhost:8085/users/me
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnby1kb3V5aW4iLCJzdWIiOiIxIiwiZXhwIjoxNzkyMjMzNDY3LCJpYXQiOjE3OTIyMjYyNjd9.Yte7Bm30MitZeGtrIib4YS1PiGCQYcor9hA79z1-F-0


### 5. 不携带Token，应该返回401
GET http://localhost:8085/users/me


### 6. 携带错误Token，应该返回401
GET http://localhost:8085/users/me
Authorization: Bearer abc.invalid.token



### 发布视频
POST http://localhost:8085/videos
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnby1kb3V5aW4iLCJzdWIiOiI0IiwiZXhwIjoxNzkyMzEzNjIzLCJpYXQiOjE3OTIzMDY0MjN9.wQPBJMy9gj9lkMkRiFGZSeSvuA0uPEfYgb3qyV1FQIU

{
  "title": "我的第三条抖音视频",
  "description": "今天分享 C 后端学习",
  "play_url": "https://example.com/video005.mp4",
  "cover_url": "https://example.com/cover005.jpg"
}
### 查询视频详情
GET http://localhost:8085/videos/1
### 查询第一页
GET http://localhost:8085/videos?page=1&page_size=10

### 未登录发布视频
POST http://localhost:8085/videos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "未登录视频",
  "play_url": "https://example.com/test.mp4"
}




### 1. 点赞视频
POST http://localhost:8085/videos/1/like
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnby1kb3V5aW4iLCJzdWIiOiIxIiwiZXhwIjoxNzkyMjQzMjE2LCJpYXQiOjE3OTIyMzYwMTZ9.M2v3J-zwL3qZmUXOEmCR95JLBQ_FHfXKJ9m33WQayOk


### 2. 再次点赞同一视频
POST http://localhost:8080/videos/1/like
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 3. 查询当前用户点赞状态
GET http://localhost:8085/videos/1/like-status
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnby1kb3V5aW4iLCJzdWIiOiIxIiwiZXhwIjoxNzkyMjQzMjE2LCJpYXQiOjE3OTIyMzYwMTZ9.M2v3J-zwL3qZmUXOEmCR95JLBQ_FHfXKJ9m33WQayOk



### 4. 查询视频详情，观察 like_count
GET http://localhost:8085/videos/1


### 5. 取消点赞
DELETE http://localhost:8085/videos/1/like
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnby1kb3V5aW4iLCJzdWIiOiIxIiwiZXhwIjoxNzkyMjQzMjE2LCJpYXQiOjE3OTIyMzYwMTZ9.M2v3J-zwL3qZmUXOEmCR95JLBQ_FHfXKJ9m33WQayOk



### 6. 再次取消点赞
DELETE http://localhost:8080/videos/1/like
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 7. 再次查询点赞状态
GET http://localhost:8085/videos/1/like-status
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnby1kb3V5aW4iLCJzdWIiOiIxIiwiZXhwIjoxNzkyMjQzMjE2LCJpYXQiOjE3OTIyMzYwMTZ9.M2v3J-zwL3qZmUXOEmCR95JLBQ_FHfXKJ9m33WQayOk



### 1. 发表一级评论
POST http://localhost:8085/videos/1/comments
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnby1kb3V5aW4iLCJzdWIiOiIxIiwiZXhwIjoxNzkyMjU1NjAxLCJpYXQiOjE3OTIyNDg0MDF9.xw3tLYwwtz2ZzbtelOXxrUUS24kqpxyp5ulaqO2agB4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "这是我的第一条评论！"
}


### 2. 查询视频一级评论
GET http://localhost:8085/videos/1/comments?page=1&page_size=10


### 3. 回复评论（将10换成实际父评论ID）
POST http://localhost:8085/videos/1/comments
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnby1kb3V5aW4iLCJzdWIiOiIxIiwiZXhwIjoxNzkyMjU1NjAxLCJpYXQiOjE3OTIyNDg0MDF9.xw3tLYwwtz2ZzbtelOXxrUUS24kqpxyp5ulaqO2agB4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "我来回复这条评论",
  "parent_id": 1
}


### 4. 查询评论回复
GET http://localhost:8085/comments/1/replies?page=1&page_size=10


### 5. 删除回复或一级评论
DELETE http://localhost:8085/comments/1
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnby1kb3V5aW4iLCJzdWIiOiIxIiwiZXhwIjoxNzkyMjU1NjAxLCJpYXQiOjE3OTIyNDg0MDF9.xw3tLYwwtz2ZzbtelOXxrUUS24kqpxyp5ulaqO2agB4



